{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01NTaW6hoPLYhku3nmWL7TAu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. Q21 written and committed.\n\n**`05-021` — Test new model before full deployment (canary, interleaved, shadow)**\n\nThe answer covers the **three-phase deployment pipeline**:\n\n1. **Phase 0 — Offline CI gate**: Golden dataset (150–300 samples), must hit Faithfulness ≥ 0.85, Recall@5 ≥ 0.70 before any deployment.\n2. **Phase 1 — Shadow mode**: New model runs in parallel on live traffic, responses never shown to users; 24–72h, ≥10K requests; checks p95 latency, cost, Faithfulness. Doubles inference cost — mitigate by sampling 10–20% of traffic.\n3. **Phase 2 — Interleaved canary**: 1% → 10% → 50% → 100% via feature flags; *interleaved* (not cohort-split) to avoid novelty bias; 48h minimum per tier; auto-rollback trigger if any SLO breaches >10% relative for >15 minutes.\n\nKey pitfalls called out: skipping shadow mode, using cohort-split instead of interleaved allocation, and not specifying rollback criteria/speed.\n\n3 items remaining in the Next queue (Q22, Q23, validate)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":364,"cache_read_input_tokens":68433,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":364,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"25d98855-eb12-45ea-9a52-28972ce7943e","uuid":"87b5dcc5-7f04-407a-a112-f93578aa44b0"}
